WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:12.584
This is Mascot for counselors. Dana runs Bright Path Admissions. Today shows what needs her attention: essays waiting for review, requests to join, deadlines coming up, and students by stage.

2
00:00:13.297 --> 00:00:20.288
Students join by invitation or with a join code, and they always approve the link. Each student chooses what they share with you.

3
00:00:20.993 --> 00:00:30.936
Open Maya and you see her profile, matches, essays and planner. Mascot built that record from her conversations, so you know who she is before your first meeting.

4
00:00:31.638 --> 00:00:36.569
Add notes for yourself or your team, set a stage, and see who else works with her.

5
00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:49.538
Essays arrive in a review queue. Comment on a highlight, or suggest a rewrite. Mascot never writes the student's essay, and neither do you, unless the student turns on direct editing. Every edit is attributed.

6
00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:58.497
Search any school, keep notes your team can share, see which of your students saved it or were matched to it, and recommend it to a student with a reason.

7
00:00:59.198 --> 00:01:04.271
Teams add counselors with different roles, and assign each student a primary counselor.

8
00:01:04.972 --> 00:01:10.599
Reports show outcomes by school without naming a student, and your records export as spreadsheets.

9
00:01:11.301 --> 00:01:17.238
You can pay for the AI of the students who need it from one monthly pool, and the rest keep using their own plan.

10
00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:24.095
Scout is free for one student. See plans for your practice at mascot-ai.com/counselors.
